23. FINAL PROJECT PITCH
-----------------------
"An AI-powered multi-sensor wildlife protection and anti-poaching early
warning system that combines thermal, visual and acoustic sensing with
autonomous aerial patrols to detect suspicious human activity and possible
gunfire in difficult-to-patrol wildlife habitats."

Stronger positioning:
The innovation is not simply "a drone with a thermal camera." It is the
combination of:
Thermal + RGB + Acoustic + GPS + AI + Sensor Fusion + Threat Assessment +
Autonomous Patrol + Persistent Tethered Surveillance + Distributed Energy.

24. IMPORTANT CLAIMS TO AVOID
-----------------------------
Avoid:
- "Thermal camera sees through trees."
- "One drone can cover the whole sanctuary."
- "AI can identify every poacher."
- "Gunshot detection is 100% accurate."
- "Drone can fly indefinitely."
- "Every forest beat needs a drone."
- "BSF outposts are Forest Department bases."

Prefer:
- "Detect exposed heat signatures."
- "Handle occlusion through multi-angle/sensor fusion."
- "Use sector-based coverage."
- "Generate alerts for human verification."
- "Use tethered UAVs for persistent surveillance in selected zones."
- "Use mobile/forward bases to extend range."
- "Clearly separate verified infrastructure from proposed infrastructure."

