-------------------------------
For an SIH-level prototype:

1. Use a small multirotor with RGB + thermal + GPS.
2. Add AI human/animal/unknown classification.
3. Add multi-frame tracking.
4. Add acoustic event detection as a second sensor.
5. Build a threat-scoring engine.
6. Integrate authorized patrol schedules.
7. Use autonomous waypoint navigation.
8. Demonstrate return-to-home on low battery.
9. Model forward/mobile battery stations.
10. Use a tethered UAV concept for one persistent high-risk zone.
11. Build a dashboard showing the map, drone, detections and alerts.
12. For Kutch, use verified public infrastructure and clearly label all
